msgid ""
"Additionally, the trailers as interpreted by linkgit:git-interpret-"
"trailers[1] are obtained as `trailers[:<option>,...]` (or by using the "
"historical alias `contents:trailers[:<option>,...]`). For valid _<option>_ "
"values see `trailers` section of linkgit:git-log[1]."
msgstr ""
